I make these lists and
I keep them to myself

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.870
and they're like a secret
checklist for myself.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:46.703
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:46.703 --> 00:00:47.910
- I don't necessarily need accountability,

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:50.040
but I go, 'cause I keep going
back to them to read them,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.630
